Z||000005||sailordude||06-04-2001||09:30 PM||||Just a few quick questions,  Are they difficult to install? Why do you need a new boot? Is that $35 with shipping? Are these just shifters that have been shortened, or are they a shift kit that shortens the shift pattern?||||reg||1
